  "track.cleancode.title": "Clean Code and Craft",
  "track.cleancode.summary": "Writing code the next person can read and change: code that fits in your head, naming and splitting functions, encapsulation and parsing once, TDD and test design, refactoring in small steps, methodical debugging, SOLID and component principles, teamwork and professionalism. Examples in Kotlin on the ClinicBook app; every rule is a heuristic credited to its author (Seemann, Martin, Moskała).",
